# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# SAVY is a Multi-Page Application (MPA).
# Clean URLs (/editor, /privacy, /tools/*) are resolved natively by Cloudflare Pages to the corresponding .html files.
# Do NOT add /route -> /route.html 200 rewrites, as they create 308 redirect loops with Cloudflare's canonical URL engine.
# Do NOT add /* -> /index.html 200 SPA catch-alls, as they swallow 404s and break direct tool routing.
